---
description: Server, Supabase, and data rules
globs: src/server/**/*.ts,src/app/api/**/*.ts,supabase/**/*
---
- All schema changes go through migrations in supabase/migrations. Never edit the DB by hand.
- Regenerate database.types.ts after each migration.
- Enable RLS on every table. Public tables are read-only; writes use the admin client on the server only.
- The service role key is never imported in client code or exposed via NEXT_PUBLIC_.
- Cron routes verify an Authorization header against CRON_SECRET.
- Sync jobs must be idempotent (use upserts keyed on the provider's match id).
- Cache provider data in the DB; never call the football API per page view.
- Read env vars only through lib/env.ts.